    <preface>
      <p>Treasury Laws Amendment (International Tax Agreements) Act 2019</p>
      <p>No. 107, 2019</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the law relating to taxation, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedules	2</p>
      <p>Schedule 1—Israeli convention	3</p>
      <p>International Tax Agreements Act 1953	3</p>
